Package: ros-lyrical-wuji-hand2-1-description
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ros-lyrical-ros-workspace
Description: Robot model description package for Wuji Hand 2.1 with URDF, MJCF, and USD assets for simulation and ROS2 visualization.
 Hand 2.1 keeps the frozen Wuji Hand 2 coordinate contract, is rooted at its arm-flange mount link, and adds a wrist IMU frame. This package provides left and right models without covers.
